  "name": "s_lf",
  "description": "A personal exocortex and hypermedia document system implemented in Rust, designed as a hybrid between a wiki, a journaling tool, and a digital garden. It employs a versatile message-based data model that supports structured text, multimedia embeds, academic references, and WASM-based dynamic content with capability-based security. The system provides a terminal user interface for managing a 'wiki-like bag of documents' and aims to facilitate decentralized social interaction.",
